---
import '@/styles/global.css';
import Consent from '@/components/Consent.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <Consent />
    <title>InstaAd — Terms &amp; Conditions · Snazzie FM</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="description" content="The full terms and conditions for InstaAd, the self-serve advertising service from Snazzie FM. All transmissions are fictional." />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Monoton&family=Bebas+Neue&family=VT323&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      :root {
        --ink: #f4d9a0;
        --ink-dim: #b89868;
        --amber: #ffb347;
        --bg: #0a0704;
        --panel: #15100a;
        --line: rgba(255, 179, 71, 0.22);
      }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      html, body { background: var(--bg); margin: 0; }
      body {
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: "VT323", monospace;
        font-size: 20px;
        line-height: 1.5;
        min-height: 100vh;
      }
      .ia-wrap {
        max-width: 56rem;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 6rem;
      }
      .ia-top {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      }
      .ia-top a { color: var(--ink-dim); text-decoration: none; transition: color .15s; }
      .ia-top a:hover { color: var(--amber); }
      .ia-ribbon {
        display: inline-block;
        background: var(--amber);
        color: #1a0f00;
        font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        padding: 0.15rem 0.7rem;
        border-radius: 2px;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }
      .ia-brand {
        font-family: "Monoton", cursive;
        font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 9vw, 4.5rem);
        color: var(--amber);
        margin: 0.4rem 0 0;
        text-shadow: 0 0 22px rgba(255, 179, 71, 0.35);
        line-height: 1;
      }
      .ia-sub {
        font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif;
        letter-spacing: 0.18em;
        color: var(--ink-dim);
        margin: 0.2rem 0 0.1rem;
      }
      .ia-meta { color: var(--ink-dim); font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0 0 2.25rem; }
      .ia-intro {
        border-left: 3px solid var(--amber);
        padding: 0.5rem 0 0.5rem 1rem;
        margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
        color: var(--ink);
      }
      section { margin: 0 0 1.9rem; }
      h2 {
        font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        color: var(--amber);
        margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
      }
      .ia-num { color: var(--ink-dim); margin-right: 0.4rem; }
      p { margin: 0 0 0.6rem; }
      ul { margin: 0.3rem 0 0.6rem; padding-left: 1.3rem; }
      li { margin: 0 0 0.3rem; }
      strong { color: var(--ink); }
      a.ia-mail { color: var(--amber); text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--amber); }
      .ia-foot {
        margin-top: 3rem;
        padding-top: 1rem;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        color: var(--ink-dim);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="ia-wrap">
      <div class="ia-top">
        <a href="/snazziefm">&larr; Snazzie&nbsp;FM</a>
        <span class="ia-ribbon">⚠ Paid Message</span>
      </div>

      <p class="ia-sub">A self-serve service of Snazzie FM</p>
      <h1 class="ia-brand">InstaAd</h1>
      <p class="ia-sub" style="letter-spacing:0.1em;">Terms &amp; Conditions</p>
      <p class="ia-meta">Effective immediately upon you hearing the jingle · Last updated never</p>

      <p class="ia-intro">
        By calling <strong>1&#8209;800&#8209;555&#8209;SNAZ</strong>, leaving a voicemail,
        clearing your throat near the receiver, or thinking about advertising at all, you
        ("the <strong>Talent</strong>") agree to the following terms with InstaAd, a
        wholly-imaginary subsidiary of Snazzie FM ("the <strong>Station</strong>").
      </p>

      <section>
        <h2><span class="ia-num">1.</span>The Spot</h2>
        <p>
          Whatever you say into the phone becomes your advertisement. There are no
          re-takes. Coughs, sighs, your spouse asking what you're doing, and the long
          silence where you forgot your own phone number are all considered part of the
          creative work and may not be removed.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2><span class="ia-num">2.</span>Airtime &amp; "Thousands of Listeners"</h2>
        <p>
          "Thousands of listeners in minutes" is an aspiration, a vibe, and a legally
          non-binding feeling. The actual figure may be:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>thousands;</li>
          <li>dozens;</li>
          <li>Barry, who is contractually obligated to listen; or</li>
          <li>nobody, during the 3 AM dead-air block.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2><span class="ia-num">3.</span>Editorial Control</h2>
        <p>
          You have none. The Station reserves the right to air your spot immediately after
          a competitor's, during a guest expert's unverified credentials, or directly into
          a music break with the volume slightly wrong. Ronnie believes in your business.
          Barry has concerns.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2><span class="ia-num">4.</span>The Blunder Clause</h2>
        <p>
          If you flub your own spot — and you will — those takes belong to the Station.
          Your second failed attempt may air <strong>instead of</strong> a successful one,
          at our discretion, for comedic value. This is a feature of InstaAd, not a defect.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2><span class="ia-num">5.</span>Refunds</h2>
        <p>
          InstaAd is free, which is also the maximum refund available. Emotional refunds
          may be requested in writing and will be filed in the dead-air block.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2><span class="ia-num">6.</span>Indemnity</h2>
        <p>
          You agree to hold the Station, its hosts, the intern (Todd, who may not be
          entirely real), and the undisclosed frequency harmless from any consequence of
          your advertisement, including but not limited to: increased business, decreased
          business, callers showing up at your home, or your jingle getting stuck in a
          listener's head for eleven years.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2><span class="ia-num">7.</span>Fictional Transmission Notice</h2>
        <p>
          All transmissions are fictional. InstaAd, its phone number, its thousands of
          listeners, and its terms are a parody. No business was harmed in the recording of
          its own spot, though several were embarrassed.
        </p>
      </section>

      <p class="ia-foot">
        Questions about these terms? Don't call the number — it isn't real. Email
        <a class="ia-mail" href="mailto:instaad@snazzie.space">instaad@snazzie.space</a>.
        SNAZZIE FM · All transmissions are fictional.
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
